# Large Project Navigation

## Objective

Find the right code quickly without loading the entire repository into context.

## Practices

- Start from module map, README, or `AGENTS.md` when present.
- Grep for symbols and paths; glob by likely directories.
- Read neighbors of a change before distant modules.
- Delegate broad exploration to focused search when appropriate.

## Cross-links

`context-caching.mdc`, `architecture.mdc`.

## Golden Rule

Search smart, read narrow, expand only when needed.